OL,3,GNEWSAReflecting on 20 years since the
OL,4,Aend of the American Adventure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe American Adventure theme park
OL,7,Fclosed its doors for the final time 20
OL,8,Fyears ago - not that the people there
OL,9,Fthat day realised it.
OL,11,FThe US-themed attraction in Derbyshire
OL,12,Fhad been drawing in crowds since its
OL,13,Fopening in 1987, and at the end of the
OL,14,F2006 season - on 29 October - staff
OL,15,Fexpected to be back at the park in
OL,16,Fspring.
OL,18,FBut that day would be the attraction's
OL,19,Flast, with news of its closure
OL,20,Fofficially confirmed in January.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
