OL,3,GNEWSAReflecting on 20 years since the
OL,4,Aend of the American Adventure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe slice of the US in the heart of the
OL,7,FEast Midlands has long since vanished,
OL,8,Freplaced by new homes, but the memories
OL,9,Flive on in those who visited.
